  - m_Id: 331463057408
    m_Localized: Mom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6194782208
    m_Localized: (...!!!!! Mom...!)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8799444992
    m_Localized: Keita...! You went outside today, didn't you?!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10422640640
    m_Localized: (Huh...?? How does she know...??????)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15799738368
    m_Localized: Why can't you listen to me?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17326465024
    m_Localized: I told you not to go out on holidays, didn't I?! Why can't you follow
      the rules?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19230679040
    m_Localized: ...You really make me angry...! I'll lecture you tomorrow! Just
      stay in your room today!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21373968384
    m_Localized: I'm sorry...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
